msgstr "📋 <b>Куди відправити повідомлення?</b>"

#: ccbot/bot.py:2918
msgid ""
"A session in tmux takes them straight away. ➕ starts a new one in a "
"directory you pick, 🕘 brings a closed one back — either way they are sent"
